id: CTB-LXM-DEC-000017-open
kind: decision
decision: LXM-DEC-000017
action: open
question: Writer assignment for the owner's "commit and push" of 2026-10-31: may the Master session write to the repository, overriding LXM-REQ-000216 (amazon-62 the sole writer), and how far
facts: amazon-62 was not running; the iCloud checkout holds a .git/index.lock that is never deleted, so no commit is possible there; pushing to the integration branch would move PR #6 off the candidate 39ed4d6
options: (a) this push only: the Master session writes new branches once, from a fresh clone outside iCloud, never the integration branch; amazon-62 stays the sole writer for everything else; (b) a standing second writer; (c) no change
recommendation: (a)
